      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS BELLA BABE (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (25.23) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Sale. Look for sharp improvement here. WHY NOT HAYDEN (8) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (23.31) over 400m at this track. The form from his last run stacks up well. Well placed and gets his chance. LOCKED AND READY (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when third (20.78) at Traralgon. Solid record here winning nine races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Leading player again. HOT SPOT (6) can measure up with the right run.",
